  biomeName: White Alabaster Pools
  minDepthMeters: 0
  maxDepthMeters: 300
  shortDescription: Terraced basins like frozen waterfalls, filled with milky mineral
    pools.
  isPlaceholder: 0
  visitPurpose: Early exploration biome. Come here to learn routes, gather basics,
    and work around bowls, pools, and local hotspots.
  commonRewardHook: Common runs pay out in Silver Ore and Gold Ore.
  rareRewardHook: 'Rare pull is modest: Lithium Crystal and Precision Lens.'
  landmarkIdentity: White Alabaster Pools reads through bowls, pools, domes, and
    hotspot basins. Landmarks should feel bright and readable.
  safePocketIdentity: Safe pockets are frequent. The player should often see a clear
    reset point nearby.
  riskSummary: 'Main failure mode: localized danger pockets and hostile basins. Creature
    pressure stays medium.'
  extractionFocus: 'Slow, careful harvesting from obvious but exposed crystal structures.
    Early tier: keep runs short and expect basin pockets, salvage traps, and local
    hotspots.'
  landmarkGuidance: Dominant landmark is crystal crown or shard grove. This slot
    should read through needle cluster and reflective seam; use bowls and hotspot
    rims to remember loops.
